* Package name    : graft
  Version         : 0.2.2
  Upstream Contact: eonik <connect@eonik.ai>
* URL             : https://github.com/eonik-ai/graft
* License         : Apache-2.0
  Programming Lang: Rust
  Description     : local-first video composition workspace

 graft is a local-first composition workspace. The incremental compiler
 is the build engine. Git owns recipe history; graft owns scions, layers,
 semantic diff, and compile. Runtime ffmpeg and ffprobe are on PATH;
 graft shells out and does not link x264.

 This ITP covers the Debian family. Ubuntu, Devuan, Kali, Trisquel,
 PureOS, Raspbian, Parrot, Pardus, deepin, openKylin, and Apertis take
 Debian. Until the package is in the archive, the same .deb is on
 GitHub Releases.

 Packaging files live in the upstream tree under dist/debian/.

 I intend to maintain this package. A sponsor is needed for the first
 upload.

 Note: crates.io crate name graft is a different program (orbitinghail
 storage engine). This source is github.com/eonik-ai/graft.
